    "why.kicker": "Why people choose me",
    "why.title": "Beautiful. Simple. Thoughtful.",
    "why.lead": "No agency, no account managers, no markup. You deal with me directly — from your first message to launch day.",
    "why.c1.title": "I explain things plainly",
    "why.c1.text": "No jargon. I’ll tell you in plain words what I’m doing, why it matters for your business and what it will cost.",
    "why.c2.title": "Built for phones first",
    "why.c2.text": "Nearly all your customers will open the site on a phone. I check every screen so nothing shifts and everything stays readable.",
    "why.c3.title": "Opens in a second",
    "why.c3.text": "People don’t wait — they leave. I keep sites light so they load instantly, even on a weak connection.",
    "why.c4.title": "Designed around your business",
    "why.c4.text": "No off-the-shelf templates. I build the look around your business, your photos and your customers — so people remember you.",
    "why.c5.title": "Enquiries reach you instantly",
    "why.c5.text": "A customer leaves a name and number and the message lands in your WhatsApp straight away. Nothing gets lost.",
    "why.c6.title": "I don’t disappear after launch",
    "why.c6.text": "The first month is free: fix a line of text, swap a photo, add a section or a promotion. Just message me.",
    "svc.kicker": "What I build",
    "svc.title": "A website for your business",
    "svc.lead": "Choose your field and explore what your business website could do.",
    "svc.s1.title": "Cafés, restaurants and coffee shops",
    "svc.s1.text": "A menu with photos, your location on a map, table booking and links to your socials. Guests get a feel for the place before they arrive.",
    "svc.s2.title": "Food delivery",
    "svc.s2.text": "A menu with prices, a basket and checkout. Completed orders arrive with the address straight to you — no phone calls, no confusion.",
    "svc.s3.title": "Retail shops",
    "svc.s3.text": "A product showcase with prices and photos, clear categories and search. Customers find what they need in a couple of taps and message you.",
    "svc.s4.title": "Beauty salons",
    "svc.s4.text": "Services and prices, your stylists’ work, reviews and online booking. Clients pick a stylist and book while you’re busy with someone else.",
    "svc.s5.title": "Independent professionals",
    "svc.s5.text": "A personal site: who you are, how you help, examples of your work, reviews and a contact button. It carries more weight than a social profile.",
    "svc.s6.title": "Small companies",
    "svc.s6.text": "A clear site covering your services, prices and team — the one a partner or client opens right before they call you.",
    "works.kicker": "Selected work",
