    "works.w2.did": "A demonstration teacher website with programmes, pricing, case studies and a booking interface.",
    "works.w2.result": "Visitors can explore the offering and enquiry flow. The demo form does not send messages.",
    "process.kicker": "How we’ll work",
    "process.title": "From idea to launch",
    "process.lead": "You don’t need to know anything about websites. Just tell me about your business — I’ll handle the rest.",
    "process.free": "free",
    "process.p1.title": "We talk",
    "process.p1.text": "You tell me about your business and your customers. I ask questions and give you a straight answer: what kind of site you need, what it will cost and how long it will take.",
    "process.p2.title": "I show you how it will look",
    "process.p2.text": "Before any building starts, you see the site as a design. We adjust colours, photos and the order of sections until you’re happy. I only move on once you say yes.",
    "process.p3.title": "I build it",
    "process.p3.text": "This part is on me. You can open the link at any point to see how it’s coming along — and say if you’d like something changed.",
    "process.p4.title": "I launch it",
    "process.p4.text": "I put the site online, connect your address (something like your-cafe.kz) and test everything across different phones and computers.",
    "process.p5.title": "I stay in touch",
